abstract: "Public academic research artifact for evidence-grounded semantic BIM/IFC sample validation, deterministic replay, integrity verification, and a planned comparative benchmark. Includes the strict public sample20 v2 contract (JSON Schema Draft 2020-12), expected-negative handling, and preliminary QLoRA compute-feasibility evidence. Code is MIT; public documentation and sample20 data are CC-BY-4.0 (see LICENSES.md)."
